    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Topical nitroglycerin 0.2% ointment, nifedipine 0.2% cream or diltiazem 2% gel, or onabotulinumtoxinA injected into the internal sphincter, relax the anal sphincter and lower resting pressure so the fissure can heal."
     }
    ]
